<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Who</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>who</a>
who admin
who builder
who guide
who clan
who status
</pre>
<p>Gives you a list of the players currently in the game. You can use this to see if 
your best friend (or enemy) is here.
</p>
<ul><li><b>who admin</b>: the administrators online.</li>
<li><b>who builder</b>: the builders online.</li>
<li><b>who guide</b>: the New Player Helpers online, who are glad to help you.</li>
<li><b>who clan</b>: the members of clans online.</li>
<li><b>who status</b>: the status players have set for themselves.</li></ul>
<p>To set your own status, the few words shown behind your name, type change and 
the words, for example change looking for a group. Words that start like one of 
the settings of <a cmd='#'>Help Change</a> switch that setting instead.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help When</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clist</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wizlist</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Change</a>
</pre>




</div>